{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"新年早々、\nAndroidだと\n乃木坂ブログが更新できない\nという事に病んだ中田です丶(；；)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前の記事\n2013年じゃないですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/sweat01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ガチで間違えました＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ2012年←\n始まりましたよ、みなさん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは\nどんな1年にしたいですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の目標とかありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はたくさんあります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cat.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログだし\nブログ的な目標を言うと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新はこれからも欠かさない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと多くの方に\nこのブログを読んでもらう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人気ブログうぃるの中田ブログを\n初期から読んでる\n中田ブログ古参のあなたを\n真上に見ます☆←黙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごちゃごちゃ言いましたが\nみなさんには\n本当に感謝してます(´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"機種は？何色？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nauのARROWS Zの黒です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/penguin.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日の出見た？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n見てないです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/bearing.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝てました←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"餅食べた？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n食べました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/restaurant.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくじひいた？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nひいてないです(´；ω；｀)\n初詣もまだです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/shock.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では今日は\nうちから質問いいですか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#1　初夢見ましたか？どんな夢でした？\n#2　オヌヌメのアプリありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2012/01/03/120102_231301.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}